inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation news cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20180509080342/https://www.eliteinfoworld.com/blog/popular-programming-languages-2018/\">\"Most Popular Programming Languages of 2018 - Elite Infoworld Blog\"</a>. 2018-03-30. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.eliteinfoworld.com/blog/popular-programming-languages-2018/\">the original</a> on 2018-05-09<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">2018-05-08</span></span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=Most+Popular+Programming+Languages+of+2018+-+Elite+Infoworld+Blog&amp;rft.date=2018-03-30&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eliteinfoworld.com%2Fblog%2Fpopular-programming-languages-2018%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ABEAM+%28Erlang+virtual+machine%29\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Zachary-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Zachary_4-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFZachary.2012\" class=\"citation book cs1\">Zachary., Kessin (2012). <i>Building web applications with Erlang</i>. Beijing: O'Reilly. <a href=\"/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ISBN (identifier)\">ISBN</a>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/9781449309961\" title=\"Special:BookSources/9781449309961\"><bdi>9781449309961</bdi></a>. <a href=\"/wiki/OCLC_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"OCLC (identifier)\">OCLC</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://search.worldcat.org/oclc/802882644\">802882644</a>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3